:{"a":0.6,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"subtitle","a":{"text":"Blood splatters everywhere. Glossy, inorganic compounds break through the cultivator. Writhing, deformed limbs support a massive, unwieldy, spherical head at an uncanny angle. And sharp, reddish spines pierce straight through the scientist's skull. It presses, reforms, and fuses together.","x":300,"y":370,"alignment":"left","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"subtitle","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Ash","text":"No matter what, we absolutely can't let that thing make it to the surface."},{"t":"line","name":"Blitz","text":"You stall it! I'll get the bomb ready!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{}}]}
